    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Backtracking</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Constraint placement</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/n-queens/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 51</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>N-Queens</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: one queen per row, so recurse row by row and pick a column; a cell is safe when its column, its <code>r - c</code> diagonal and its <code>r + c</code> anti-diagonal are all unused, which three boolean arrays answer in O(1). O(n!) time in the worst case, O(n) extra space.</p>\n"
